// runner may set all derive from this one table.
//
// Check kinds:
//   api      automated by the harness over HTTP
//   db       read-only SQL evidence, generated by the harness and run by the operator
//   operator read-only host command run by the operator (logs, audit, snapshots)
//   manual   a person looks at a UI or device
//   local    needs control only a disposable stack gives (held locks, a gate on
//            renders); can't run on staging, and never counts toward acceptance
//
// `approval: true` means disruptive or leaves a lasting effect: the test stays
// BLOCKED until the Product Owner's approval is passed with --approve.

